      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactoryName</code> - the name under which the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> is to be added",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactoryName</code> - 要添加提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 的名称",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Useful for testing environments or applications that need to match\narbitrary <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> names to target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> objects.",
      "translation": "适用于测试环境或需要匹配任意 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 名称以定位目标 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 对象的应用程序。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> is <code>null</code>, then this method call effectively has no effect.",
      "translation": "如果提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>为<code>null</code>，则此方法调用实际上没有任何效果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> to the map of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> instances maintained by this object.",
      "translation": "将提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 添加到此对象维护的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 实例映射中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieve the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> identified by the given name.",
      "translation": "检索给定名称的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactories</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>.\nThe keys are <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>, the values are actual <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactories</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>。\n键为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>，值为实际的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a> to be added",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - 要添加的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>",
